# Bench harness: track the code and the hand-curated reference text, so a run
# is reproducible on another machine. Everything heavy stays out — input PDFs
# (6.8M), per-run results, the venv, and the image/.mdm byproducts sitting
# next to each ground_truth document.md (23M of the 23.3M there).
bench/.venv/
bench/results/
bench/regressions/
bench/fixtures/
bench/__pycache__/
bench/config.local.toml*
# README: the repo ships no adapter code for any specific external parser —
# those are configured per-developer against local clones in ../reference/.
bench/adapters/ext_*.py
bench/ground_truth/**/*.mdm
bench/ground_truth/**/*.jpg
bench/ground_truth/**/*.jpeg
bench/ground_truth/**/*.png
bench/ground_truth/**/*.raw
bench/ground_truth/**/assets/
